      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently I'm using webpack to convert modern JS into ES5 compatible with the (ancient) webpanels and inline the JS into the HTML file.\n\nIn particular I'm using the `html-webpack-plugin` and `script-ext-html-webpack-plugin` plugins for this.\n\nAs for old JS conversions this uses `babel-loader`.\nYou can skip the last one if you're not using JSX for react.\n```\nloader: 'babel-loader',\noptions: {\n\tpresets: ['env'],\n\tplugins: [\n\t\t'transform-es2015-block-scoping',\n\t\t'transform-es2015-template-literals',\n\t\t'syntax-object-rest-spread',\n\t\t'transform-object-rest-spread',\n\t\t[\"transform-react-jsx\", { \"pragma\":\"h\" }]\n\t]\n}\n```",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
